; http-fetch.no — JS fetch wrapper (Node 18+)
;
; Wraps the JavaScript fetch API (available in Node 18+ and browsers).
; Under the JS backend, calls to http-fetch(url) map to fetch(url) and
; return the response body as a string.
; On non-JS backends this declaration is excluded by the #{js} platform annotation.
#{js}
http-fetch = (url str) (data str) {
    data = ''
}
